From 1c35c45204c1b99fed698cd3d565d724e560766d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 22:35:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER (tools 0160): stop F5's build; the find window
 hides itself; F5 frees the program first; save buttons; starts with VS Code
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 1003:
- "我要在編譯過程中可以按下圖片中停止 來停止編譯": during F5's build stop is lit
  (title bar + 方案總管, state 'building'); it ends that task (terminate) and its
  process tree by ITS pid (taskkill /T -- another session's build in the tree is
  untouched), then deletes the exes this build wrote (mtime >= its start: a
  half-linked exe would pass for up to date); the build window says stopped.
- "我需要的是隱藏 有需要搜尋在出現 focus到別的視窗 就隱藏 不要讓使用者看到 也點不出來":
  the find window closes when the focus goes elsewhere (onDidChangeViewState,
  not in its first 1.5 s -- floating moves it), so it is off the task bar; Ctrl+F
  brings it back with the last results; a result click keeps the focus in it
  (preserveFocus). find.hideOnBlur.
- "為啥我都已經關掉程式了 我還需要按按鈕停止 才可以編譯": the HMI closed, wb_serve
  still running holds its exe. A cppdbg resolveDebugConfigurationWithSubstitutedVariables
  (before the preLaunchTask) ends the program about to be rebuilt: its sessions,
  its process (that exe path only), waited for. The designer's ▶ stops what runs
  instead of asking for ⏹ (another folder's wb_serve is still refused).
  run.freeBeforeBuild.
- "我上方按鈕也需要檔案儲存按鈕": save / save all first on the title bar toolbar
  (greyed with nothing to save).
- "你搜尋關鍵字視窗模組 請你開軟體就自動啟用好 並且我沒按ctrl+F 請先隱藏":
  onStartupFinished; find / build windows VS Code would bring back are closed
  (serializers that dispose them).

Tests: run_all 3/3 layers (extension 233); real VS Code 156/159 (3 known stale).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
